                                                "sense_id": "3f3e7c9d-4456-31fd-a0b0-02083e2c8bda",
                                                "text": "\"Now I'll learn you something Long Jack can't,\" shouted Tom Platt, as from a locker by the stern he produced a battered deep-sea lead hollowed at one end, smeared the hollow from a saucer full of mutton tallow, and went forward. \"I'll learn you how to fly the Blue Pigeon. Shooo!\"\n[…] The lead sung a deep droning song as Tom Platt whirled it round and round."
